Orientation: You are about to explore the WNDR Museum Boston, a hub of interactive art and technology. Within its walls, you will encounter 7 distinct works: Flex, Speak Up!, Lake Shore Drive (LSD), MPO-1 (Time Machine), Buy Gift Cards - WNDR Boston, and WNDRWall. Each piece offers a unique perspective on the theme of perception and innovation. Delve into this world where creativity and technology intersect, sparking new ideas and challenging conventional thinking. Explore how art and technology collaborate to redefine our understanding of the world around us, all within the dynamic space of WNDR Museum Boston. As you continue on this tour, you will discover the closure of WNDR Museum Boston on August 30th, 2023, after six years at Flex | WNDR Museum Boston, and its final closure in September 2026 at Lake Shore Drive (LSD) | WNDR Museum Boston. Your first stop is Flex | WNDR Museum Boston. As you step into the WNDR Museum Boston space, pause at the beginning of the Flex installation to see the dance of light and shadows come alive. The interplay of dynamic motion and illumination invites you into a realm where perception shifts continuously.

